{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321219001:1":{"text":"사람 그림자라곤 보이지도 않아... 어쩌면 늦은 게 아닐까?","source_cn":"完全没有看到人影……也许，还是晚了一步吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7C23B570357E6E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321219002:1":{"text":"그런 말 하지 마! 아직 끝까지 가보지 않았잖아!","source_cn":"不许说丧气话！还没走到头呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C012DCCC36C6749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321219003:1":{"text":"음, 발자국이 저쪽을 향해 있어요.","source_cn":"唔，鞋印往那边去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F9AE6C53C15726E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321219004:1":{"text":"이 방향을 따라 조금만 더 가봐요.","source_cn":"沿着这个方向再走走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D58B7178FC0E4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321219005:1":{"text":"그렇게 느려 터져서 어떻게 따라가겠어!","source_cn":"你们慢吞吞地，怎么来得及！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5F35EF46E6EF20A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321219006:1":{"t